1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:13,020
What was the danger to the villages after the fire?
大火之后村庄面临什么危险？

2
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:17,890
What was the danger to the villages after the fire?
大火之后村庄面临什么危险？

3
00:00:20,340 --> 00:00:23,270
Firemen had been fighting the forest fire
消防队员与森林大火搏斗了

4
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:27,850
for nearly three weeks before they could get it under control.
将近三个星期才把火势控制住。

5
00:00:29,010 --> 00:00:35,700
A short time before, great trees had covered the countryside for miles around.
不久前，周围几英里的乡间还覆盖着大树。

6
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:43,190
Now, smoke still rose up from the warm ground over the desolate hills.
现在，荒凉的山丘上温热的土地仍在冒着烟。

7
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:47,770
Winter was coming on and the hills threatened
冬天即将来临，这些山丘

8
00:00:47,790 --> 00:00:50,270
the surrounding villages with destruction,
威胁着周围的村庄，

9
00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:54,710
for heavy rain would not only wash away the soil
因为大雨不仅会冲走土壤，

10
00:00:54,730 --> 00:00:58,270
but would cause serious floods as well.
还会造成严重的水灾。

11
00:00:59,490 --> 00:01:02,500
When the fire had at last been put out,
大火终于被扑灭后，

12
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:10,400
the forest authorities ordered several tons of a special type of grass-seed which would grow quickly.
森林管理当局订购了几吨生长迅速的特殊草籽。

13
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:18,150
The seed was sprayed over the ground in huge quantities by aeroplanes.
飞机把这些草籽大量地撒在地上。

14
00:01:19,030 --> 00:01:24,880
The planes had been planting seed for nearly a month when it began to rain.
飞机播种了将近一个月，天开始下雨了。

15
00:01:25,710 --> 00:01:31,220
By then, however, in many places the grass had already taken root.
不过那时许多地方的草已经生根了。

16
00:01:32,040 --> 00:01:36,230
In place of the great trees which had been growing there for centuries,
取代在那里生长了几个世纪的大树的，

17
00:01:36,250 --> 00:01:40,850
patches of green had begun to appear in the blackened soil.
是一片片绿色开始出现在烧黑的土地上。
